From 2f9c0ff91c643fee73eb8ba98e4a9acc460c6720 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 22:28:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(automation): register CRM notify actions so follow-up
 events process

#283 mapped crm.followup_due and crm.risk_detected onto typed actions that
were not in the catalog, so the production worker failed the outbox with
UNKNOWN_ACTION. Add notify-only definitions and handlers, fail-soft unknown
mappings, and keep mutation off. No CRM table writes.
---
 .../handlers/verticalActionHandlers.ts        |  2 +
 server/automation/typedActionRegistry.ts      |  2 +
 server/automation/verticalEvents.ts           | 72 ++++++++++--------
 tests/autonomous_operations_verticals.test.ts | 73 ++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 119 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

